# Millpond demo reel: 12 s at 60 fps.
#     mptest --film 720 --size 1280x720 --script docs/demo.cues | ffmpeg ...
# A pebble in the middle, a second off to one side, a skimmed stone across
# the bottom third, then a squall.
#
# Tracks are held before their first key and interpolated BETWEEN keys, so
# every button is keyed down for exactly one frame with a 0 on the frames
# either side -- `29 Drop 0 / 30 Drop 1 / 31 Drop 0`. Without the key before,
# the value ramps up from the last one and the press lands halfway there.
0    Rain        0.2
0    Pebble X    0.5
0    Pebble Y    0.5
0    Drop        0
29   Drop        0
30   Drop        1
31   Drop        0
140  Pebble X    0.5
141  Pebble X    0.27
140  Pebble Y    0.5
141  Pebble Y    0.64
149  Drop        0
150  Drop        1
151  Drop        0
0    Skim        0
290  Pebble X    0.27
291  Pebble X    0.5
290  Pebble Y    0.64
291  Pebble Y    0.3
299  Skim        0
300  Skim        1
301  Skim        0
480  Rain        0.2
520  Rain        0.55
600  Rain        0.55
660  Rain        0.2
